# Build
bin/
dist/
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
*.prof
*.exe
# `go build ./cmd/X` (sem -o) deixa o binário na raiz com o nome do
# diretório — o Taskfile escreve em bin/exchangeos-X, mas o build cru não
# passa por lá. api/erasure-worker/migrator/worker chegaram a estar TRACKED
# no índice (13–33 MB cada); saíram com `git rm --cached` (decisão do dono,
# 2026-10-21) e ficam cobertos aqui para não repetir.
/api
/worker
/migrator
/cred-rotator
/erasure-worker
/healthcheck
/eod
/mq-bridge
/cls-cycle

# Generated
proto/gen/

# Env / secrets — NEVER commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Local data
docker/compose/data/
docker/compose/logs/
# data/* excludes runtime data subdirs but allows data/bacen/ (regulatory
# source-of-truth: CSV + golden corpus required for codegen + drift guard +
# accuracy harness). The negation only works because the parent itself
# (data/) is NOT excluded.
data/*
!data/bacen/
logs/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Go cache
.cache/

# Lefthook
lefthook-local.yml

# Audit logs (gitignored — audit-bypass.log)
.git/audit-bypass.log

# Claude scratch
.claude/cache/
.claude/memory/local/
